# C8 anion addition: embedded DLPNO single point on the PRODUCT STATE (adduct).
#
# Geometry: geometry_b973c-xtb/ps_anion/job.xyz (B97-3c minimum, E=-934.481754;
# the un-H-bonded conformer, H132...O129 = 3.845 A). ANION model (133 atoms,
# charge -1), QM1 = the 17-atom region {55 58 61 64 120...132}.
#
# QM1 = DLPNO-CCSD(T)/def2-TZVPP (def2-TZVPP/C), NormalPNO; QM2 = 116 host atoms
# at GFN2-xTB with GFN-FF topology, Hirshfeld embedding; whole system
# ddCOSMO(water). Single point; the composite uses the B97-3c geometry tier's G:
# orca_io.composite_free_energy_eh(geom, T, this, geom).
#
# Charge convention: QM region charge on the *xyzfile line; Charge_total = whole
# system. QM -1, host 0, total -1.
! QM/XTB DLPNO-CCSD(T) def2-TZVPP def2-TZVPP/C ddCOSMO(Water) TightSCF

%QMMM
QMATOMS
	{55 58 61 64 120 121 122 123 124 125 126 127 128 129 130 131 132}
END
Charge_total -1
Mult_total 1
AutoFF_QM2_Method GFNFF
END

%output jsonpropfile true end

%maxcore 4000

%pal
   nprocs 8
end

* xyzfile -1 1 job.xyz
